# Requisições para o backend completo deste pacote. Configure banco/segredo e inicie primeiro.
# Extensão REST Client do VS Code pode usar estas variáveis.
@base = http://localhost:8080/api
@token = PREENCHA_COM_TOKEN_DA_RESPOSTA
@categoryId = 1
@plantId = 1

### Cadastro
POST {{base}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Pessoa de Teste","email":"teste@example.com","password":"senha-teste-123"}

### Login
POST {{base}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{"email":"teste@example.com","password":"senha-teste-123"}

### Sessão
GET {{base}}/auth/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar categoria (guardar ID retornado)
POST {{base}}/categories
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Interior"}

### Plantas filtradas
GET {{base}}/plants?name=Monstera&categoryId={{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Criar planta; lastWatering null não depende da data atual
POST {{base}}/plants
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Monstera","species":"Monstera deliciosa","location":"Sala","wateringFrequency":7,"lastWatering":null,"sunlight":"Luz indireta","notes":"Evitar sol direto","imageUrl":null,"categoryId":{{categoryId}},"outdoor":false}

### Detalhe
GET {{base}}/plants/{{plantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Dashboard
GET {{base}}/plants/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Editar planta
PUT {{base}}/plants/{{plantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Monstera editada","species":"Monstera deliciosa","location":"Varanda","wateringFrequency":5,"lastWatering":null,"sunlight":"Luz indireta","notes":null,"imageUrl":null,"categoryId":{{categoryId}},"outdoor":true}

### Editar categoria
PUT {{base}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"name":"Folhagens"}

### Categoria com planta deve recusar exclusão
DELETE {{base}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sem token deve retornar 401 ApiError
GET {{base}}/plants

### Depois do teste, excluir planta e categoria
DELETE {{base}}/plants/{{plantId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Categoria vazia
DELETE {{base}}/categories/{{categoryId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

# Upload (terminal, substitua TOKEN/ID e caminho):
# curl -X POST http://localhost:8080/api/plants/ID/photo -H "Authorization: Bearer TOKEN" -F "file=@foto.jpg;type=image/jpeg"
# Usar token da segunda conta no detalhe/PUT/DELETE/upload de ID da primeira deve retornar 404.
